{"parse": {"title": "Y\u016bki Kawamura", "pageid": 16414886, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"bandeau-container metadata bandeau-article bandeau-niveau-ebauche\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:5px\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Icons8_flat_sports_mode.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Icons8_flat_sports_mode.svg/40px-Icons8_flat_sports_mode.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Icons8_flat_sports_mode.svg/120px-Icons8_flat_sports_mode.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span> <span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Nuvola_Japan_flag.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Nuvola_Japan_flag.svg/40px-Nuvola_Japan_flag.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Nuvola_Japan_flag.svg/120px-Nuvola_Japan_flag.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\">\n<p><strong class=\"bandeau-titre\">Cet article est une <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:%C3%89bauche\" title=\"Aide:\u00c9bauche\">\u00e9bauche</a> concernant un <a href=\"/wiki/Sport\" title=\"Sport\">sportif</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Japon\" title=\"Japon\">japonais</a>.</strong>\n</p>\n<div class=\"nomobile\">\nVous pouvez partager vos connaissances en l\u2019am\u00e9liorant (<b><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">comment&#160;?</a></b>) selon les recommandations des <a href=\"/wiki/Projet:Accueil\" title=\"Projet:Accueil\">projets correspondants</a>.</div>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">Y\u016bki Kawamura<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Yuki_Kawamura_2020-2021.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article Y\u016bki Kawamura\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Yuki_Kawamura_2020-2021.jpg/250px-Yuki_Kawamura_2020-2021.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Yuki_Kawamura_2020-2021.jpg/500px-Yuki_Kawamura_2020-2021.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1365\" data-file-height=\"2048\" /></a></span> <br />Y\u016bki Kawamura en 2020-2021.\n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<t