br /><a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2024-2025\" title=\"Saison NBA 2024-2025\">2024-2025</a><br />2024-2025<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2025-2026\" title=\"Saison NBA 2025-2026\">2026</a><br />2026</td><td valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=San-en_NeoPhoenix&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San-en NeoPhoenix (page inexistante)\">San-en NeoPhoenix</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San-en_NeoPhoenix\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:San-en NeoPhoenix\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;San-en NeoPhoenix&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Yokohama_B-Corsairs&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Yokohama B-Corsairs (page inexistante)\">Yokohama B-Corsairs</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yokohama_B-Corsairs\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Yokohama B-Corsairs\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;Yokohama B-Corsairs&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a></span><br />Yokohama B-Corsairs<br />Yokohama B-Corsairs<br />Yokohama B-Corsairs<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Grizzlies_de_Memphis\" title=\"Grizzlies de Memphis\">Grizzlies de Memphis</a><br /><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hustle_de_Memphis\" title=\"Hustle de Memphis\">Hustle de Memphis</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Bulls_de_Chicago\" title=\"Bulls de Chicago\">Bulls de Chicago</a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bulls_de_Windy_City\" title=\"Bulls de Windy City\">Bulls de Windy City</a></span></td><td valign=\"top\">12,6<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>6,0<br />10,0<br />19,5<br />20,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,6<br />12,4<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">S\u00e9lection en \u00e9quipe nationale **</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2022-</td><td valign=\"top\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Japan.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Japon\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/20px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/40px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_du_Japon_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe du Japon masculine de basket-ball\">Japon</a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>** Points marqu\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9quipe nationale en match officiel.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Y\u016bki Kawamura</b> <span style=\"font-weight: normal\">(<span title=\"Japonais\" class=\"lang-ja\" lang=\"ja\">\u6cb3\u6751 \u52c7\u8f1d</span>, <i title=\"Transcription Hepburn\" class=\"lang-ja-Latn-alalc97\" lang=\"ja-Latn-alalc97\">Kawamura Y\u016bki</i><span class=\"t&#95;nihongo&#95;help noprint\"><span class=\"t&#95;nihongo&#95;icon\" style=\"color:#00e;font:bold 80% sans-serif;text-decoration:none;padding:0 .1em;\"><sup><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Japonais\" title=\"Aide:Japonais\">?</a></sup></span></span>)</span>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"2001-05-02\" data-sort-value=\"2001-05-02\"><a href=\"/wiki/2_mai_en_sport\" title=\"2 mai en sport\">2 mai</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2001_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2001 en basket-ball\">2001</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Yanai\" title=\"Yanai\">Yanai</a> au <a href=\"/wiki/Japon\" title=\"Japon\">Japon</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Japon\" title=\"Japon\">japonais</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> \u00e9voluant au poste de <a href=\"/wiki/Meneur\" title=\"Meneur\">meneur</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-10-19\" data-sort-value=\"2024-10-19\">19 octobre 2024</time>, Kawamura signe un contrat <i><span class=\"lang-en\" lang=\"en\">two-way</span></i> avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Grizzlies_de_Memphis\" title=\"Grizzlies de Memphis\">Grizzlies de Memphis</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-07-19\" data-sort-value=\"2025-07-19\">19 juillet 2025</time>, apr\u00e8s une campagne de Summer League int\u00e9ressante, il signe un contrat <i><span class=\"lang-en\" lang=\"en\">two-way</span></i> avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Bulls_de_Chicago\" title=\"Bulls de Chicago\">Bulls de Chicago</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Il est malgr\u00e9 tout coup\u00e9 mi-<time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-10\" data-sort-value=\"2025-10\">octobre 2025</time> avant le d\u00e9but de saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>D\u00e9but <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-01\" data-sort-value=\"2026-01\">janvier 2026</time>, de retour d'un souci m\u00e9dical, il signe \u00e0 nouveau avec les Bulls, toujours sous la forme d'un contrat <i>two-way</i><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_internationale\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_internationale\"></span>Carri\u00e8re internationale</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re internationale\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re internationale\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Kawamura dispute les <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball_aux_Jeux_olympiques_d%27%C3%A9t%C3%A9_de_2024\" title=\"Basket-ball aux Jeux olympiques d&#39;\u00e9t\u00e9 de 2024\">Jeux olympiques 2024</a> avec le Japon. Lors du premier tour face \u00e0 la France, il inscrit 29 points, prend 7 rebonds et r\u00e9alise 7 passes d\u00e9cisives face aux futurs vice-champions olympiques<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Notes_et_r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"Notes_et_r.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Y%C5%ABki_Kawamura&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small decimal\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nba.com/grizzlies/news/grizzlies-promote-yuki-kawamura-to-two-way-contract\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Grizzlies promote Yuki Kawamura to two-way contract</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">nba.com</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-10-19\" data-sort-value=\"2024-10-19\">19 octobre 2024</time></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span cl